@* What Pollyanna is, long version (spec §7 About text): on the empty home only, below the cloth.
   The hat and slips describe the real tradition, so they stay. The short version is _AboutShort. *@
<p class="about small soft">Every family has a version of this: names on folded slips, a hat going round the table, someone squinting at the handwriting. Around Philadelphia they call it a Pollyanna. This is that, minus the squinting.</p>
